<section class="sp-section sp-section--paper"><div class="sp-shell sp-page-grid"><div class="sp-prose">
<h2>AFTER YOUR APPOINTMENT.</h2><p>Your artist's instructions are the starting point for your specific tattoo, piercing, or cosmetic service. If you need another copy or have questions about what you were told, reach out to the studio.</p>
<div class="sp-faq"><details open><summary>Tattoo aftercare</summary><p>Ask your tattoo artist for the instructions that match your tattoo and the dressing used at your appointment. Keep those instructions handy, and check with the studio before changing the routine.</p><a class="sp-link" href="/pages/contact">Ask your tattoo artist <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></details><details><summary>Piercing aftercare</summary><p>Your piercer can explain the care plan for your placement and jewelry, including when to return for follow-up. Contact the studio if you need the written instructions again.</p><a class="sp-link" href="/pages/contact">Talk to Sonny <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></details><details><summary>Tooth gems &amp; whitening</summary><p>Contact Megan for the instructions specific to your treatment and any questions about the products used at your session.</p><a class="sp-link" href="/pages/contact">Talk to Megan <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></details><details><summary>Questions or concerns?</summary><p>The studio can help with your artist's instructions and follow-up appointments. Concerns that need medical or dental assessment should be discussed with a qualified healthcare professional.</p><a class="sp-link" href="tel:+13855479547">Call (385) 547-9547</a></details></div>
</div><aside class="sp-sidebar"><h3>Your artist knows your piece.</h3><p>Not every tattoo, piercing, or service needs the same routine. Start with the guidance provided at your appointment.</p><a class="sp-button sp-button--red" href="/pages/contact">Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><hr><h3>Aftercare essentials</h3><p>Ask the studio which available products are appropriate for your service.</p><a class="sp-link" href="/pages/shop">Explore the shop <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></aside></div></section>
